Dellent is a consulting company focused in System Information and Telecommunications. Our goal is to help our candidates and consultants to take a step forward in their careers through projects that meet their needs and expectations.

This project is part of the business investment banking and financial services area, that currently has its technological hub in Portugal and is working on the development of innovative solutions and support for all operations related to the business.

We are looking for a Senior .NET Developer
to work in this project in Porto (Hybrid).

Must Have

More than 9 years of experience in a similar role;
Experience with Development Tools & Platforms: Git, CLR, XLD, Azure DevOps, Jenkins;
Experience with C# (.NET) and Oracle/PLSQL;
Fluent in English.

Additional Requirements

Strong technical skills in Sophis customization, integration, and troubleshooting;
Being sensitive to technical and functional issues of regulatory context;
Understanding of financial regulations and their impact on trading systems is desirable.

Nice To Have

Good understanding of C++, Java, Python;
Knowledge of Power BI for dashboarding;
Scripting: PowerShell, CMD (Command Prompt).

What can you expect from us?

Health insurance;
A personalized training plan, with a budget to spend on the training you find necessary;
Constant feedback so you can grow professionally;
Remote onboarding process;
Team events every semester so you can live new adventures;
Culture of proximity and transparency. Your ideas and needs are heard and valued by us!

Apply

